00:16:44.000 --> 00:17:52.000
One night, Cornelius asked Timothy to again confirm what had happened. He changed his story, this time saying Beryl was pregnant by another man so he had left her and would never see her again. Meanwhile, Timothy's mother and sisters hadn't heard from him in more than a fortnight. On Sunday, November 27, Timothy's sister Eileen visited 10 Rillington Place only to find the Evans' top story flat quiet. She inquired with the neighbors and spoke to the occupants of the ground floor flat, a middle-aged couple named John and Ethel Christie. Ethel reported that Beryl had left the property with Geraldine almost three weeks earlier on Tuesday, November 8. She was certain of it as she helped Beryl carry her bags. Ethel's husband to John told Eileen, they've had a row, best to leave young couples alone.
一天晚上，科尼利厄斯要求蒂莫西再次确认发生了什么。他改变了说法，这次说贝瑞尔怀上了别人的孩子，所以他离开了她，再也不会见到她了。与此同时，蒂莫西的母亲和姐妹们已经有半个多月没听到他的消息了。11月27日星期日，蒂莫西的姐姐艾琳拜访了灵顿街10号，却发现埃文斯夫妇的顶层公寓一片安静。她向邻居打听，并与一楼公寓的住户——一对名叫约翰和埃瑟尔·克里斯特的中年夫妇交谈了。埃瑟尔报告说，贝瑞尔大约在三周前的11月8日星期二带着杰拉丁离开了这里。她对此确信不疑，因为她曾帮贝瑞尔拎过包。埃瑟尔的丈夫约翰对艾琳说：“他们吵了一架，最好别管年轻夫妇的事。”

