01:09:24.000 --> 01:10:38.000
He asserted that elements of his client's story were not something that an uneducated illiterate man could invent. He explained that his client made no admissions that Geraldine was dead until after he was told her body had been found, at which point he confessed due to his fear of the police. The trial judge reminded the jury that they were only required to reach a verdict regarding Geraldine Evans' murder. Despite the defense's story that Beryl had died after arranging for John Christie to perform an abortion, the judge clarified that she had not died from such a procedure and added, Evans is a person who does not hesitate to lie. The jury deliberated for 40 minutes before returning with their verdict. They found Timothy Evans guilty of the murder of his one-year-old daughter Geraldine. In 1950, death was the mandatory sentence for murder. When asked if he had anything to say as to why the court should not sentence him to death, Timothy replied,
他断言，他当事人故事中的某些元素不是一个受教育程度不高的文盲能够凭空捏造的。他解释说，直到被告知杰拉丁的尸体被找到后，他的当事人并没有承认杰拉丁已经死亡，在那个时候，他因为害怕警察而供认了。审判法官提醒陪审团，他们只需要就杰拉丁·埃文斯谋杀案达成裁决。尽管辩方称贝瑞尔是在安排约翰·克里斯蒂进行堕胎后死亡的，但法官澄清说她并非死于此类手术，并补充说：“埃文斯是一个毫不犹豫地撒谎的人。”陪审团经过40分钟的审议后作出了裁决。他们裁定蒂莫西·埃文斯谋杀他一岁的女儿杰拉丁罪名成立。在1950年，死刑是谋杀罪的强制性判决。当被问及他是否有话要说，以说明法院不应判处他死刑时，蒂莫西回答：

