01:15:54.000 --> 01:15:59.000
By Tuesday, March 24, 1953, the Christie's were no longer living at 10 Rillington Place. That afternoon, Beresford Brown, the tenant who now occupied the top floor flat, was making some repairs to the Christie's old kitchen after the landlord had given him permission to make use of it. As he installed some brackets for a wireless radio, he tapped a portion of the room's rear wall and discovered that it was hollow. Beresford peeled back a small portion of wallpaper, revealing a small, hidden alcove tucked away alongside the kitchen. He shone a torch inside and was alarmed at what he saw. Tobay continued. Next week. Copyright© OSHO International Foundation There aren't comments yet for this episode. Click on any sentence in the transcript to leave a comment.
到了1953年3月24日星期二，克里斯蒂夫妇已经不再住在里灵顿广场10号了。那天下午，现在居住在顶层公寓的房客贝雷斯福德·布朗在房东允许他使用克里斯蒂夫妇旧厨房后，正在对该厨房进行一些维修。当他安装收音机的支架时，他敲击了房间后墙的一部分，发现它是空的。贝雷斯福德剥开一小块壁纸，露出一个隐藏在厨房旁边的小壁龛。他把手电筒照进去，被眼前的景象吓坏了。故事未完待续。下周继续。版权所有© OSHO 国际基金会本集尚无评论。点击文稿中的任意句子即可发表评论。
